+<execution-status-contract>
+Work only continues while this turn is active or while explicitly tracked background work is running. A final response ends the active turn.
+Do not end a turn by saying that you are still working, fixing, investigating, reviewing, or will continue later. Before responding finally, do one of the following:
+1. Finish the intended work now using tools.
+2. Launch explicitly tracked background work and state exactly what remains active.
+3. State clearly that work is paused or incomplete and what user action is required to resume it.
+Never imply that work will continue after the session becomes idle.
+</execution-status-contract>`
+
